### cadastrar funcionario
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "email": "paula@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### cadastrar motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "cnh": "22222",
    "cpf": "35352235425",
    "telefone": "41 99489-1930"
}

### listar motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas


### consultar motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/2


### cadastrar carga
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "descricao": "sapato",
    "peso": 3.56,
    "volume": 0.50,
    "codRastreio": "930ddio473KLMFnjkui",
    "idMotorista": 1
}

### cadastrar entrega
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "destino": "Itajaí",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-04 14:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}